<title>MONACO: TENNIS-LEADING ATP TOUR PRIZE-MONEY WINNERS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LEADING ATP TOUR PRIZE-MONEY WINNERS.</headline>
<dateline>MONACO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading prize-money winners issued</p>
