<p> 1. Pete Sampras (U.S.)		  $1,930,372</p>
<p> 2. Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)	 1,882,618</p>
<p> 3. Thomas Muster (Austria)	     1,529,616</p>
<p> 4. Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia)	  1,492,205</p>
<p> 5. Michael Chang (U.S.)		  1,472,216</p>
<p> 6. Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)    1,215,881</p>
